 "facts": [
  "Nextstep4u: TNPSC Group 4 mock tests in Tamil and English, with an AI report after every test (marks by section, weak topics).",
  "Group 4 paper: General Tamil, General Studies and Aptitude; 200 questions, 300 marks, 3 hours.",
  "Daily Challenge: 25 questions in 23 minutes, one scored attempt, the full AI report; nothing renews; each day's closes at 11:59 PM IST. ₹9 is a sale price; the normal price is ₹15.",
  "Website: nextstep4u.in (the ad's landing page is nextstep4u.in/try.html). The Android app is live on Google Play (since 12 Nov 2026; search 'Nextstep4u'); there is no iPhone app.",
  "Never say 'free'. Never promise a job, a rank, marks or a pass. No invented numbers, testimonials, buyer counts or countdowns. Example figures stay labelled as examples."
 ]
